  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1278\">\n<li data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1118\">\n<p data-start=\"1033\" data-end=\"1118\">Factor VIII positivity confirms the <strong data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1091\">endothelial nature</strong> of highlighted structures.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1119\" data-end=\"1159\">\n<p data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1159\">Suggestive of a <strong data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1156\">vascular lesion</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1278\">\n<p data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1278\">Correlation with morphology and other endothelial markers (CD31, CD34, ERG) is advised in suspected vascular tumors.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
